    "48ca768a-a8cc-5596-a246-2cd45f23ca39": {
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "name": "11. What, when, where and how in 160 characters",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 10.46,
        "extent": [
          8421319.48,
          3274212.69,
          8643958.46,
          3382011.46
        ],
        "enableIdentify": true,
        "content": {
          "contentMode": "map",
          "markdown": "<div style='font-size:18px; line-height:1.55; min-height:84vh;'><div style='font-size:14px; color:#64748b; letter-spacing:.03em; margin:0 0 8px;'>4 · Message design principles · Additional method</div><ol style='margin:0 0 10px 22px; padding:0;'><li style='margin:0 0 5px;'><b>What (value and category), when (IST peak), where (site), how (one or two actions)</b>. <code style='background:rgba(100,116,139,.18); padding:0 4px; border-radius:4px; font-size:.92em;'>short</code> for SMS/push, <code style='background:rgba(100,116,139,.18); padding:0 4px; border-radius:4px; font-size:.92em;'>long</code> for app detail and briefings.</li><li style='margin:0 0 5px;'><b>CPCB category names verbatim</b> (Good / Satisfactory / Moderate / Poor / Very Poor / Severe), matching the news and the official app.</li><li style='margin:0 0 5px;'><b>Name sensitive groups first</b> (children, older adults, pregnant women, respiratory patients).</li><li style='margin:0 0 5px;'><b>GRAP as \"corresponding level\" only</b>; enforcement is CAQM's call, so \"may be enforced\" plus a pointer to official notices.</li><li style='margin:0 0 5px;'><b>One sentence of meteorological reasoning</b>; people who understand why nights are worse comply better.</li><li style='margin:0 0 5px;'><b>A fixed disclaimer</b>: \"AI-model (Aurora) guidance for information only; follow official CPCB/CAQM alerts.\"</li><li style='margin:0 0 5px;'>Hindi first, English second, Korean for the operating team. Templates live in <code style='background:rgba(100,116,139,.18); padding:0 4px; border-radius:4px; font-size:.92em;'>HEALTH_ADVICE</code>, <code style='background:rgba(100,116,139,.18); padding:0 4px; border-radius:4px; font-size:.92em;'>GRAP_ADVICE</code> and <code style='background:rgba(100,116,139,.18); padding:0 4px; border-radius:4px; font-size:.92em;'>CATEGORY_NAMES</code> so health experts can review wording without code.</li></ol></div>",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "paneAlignment": "start",
          "panelWidth": "50%"
        },
