        "enableIdentify": true,
        "content": {
          "contentMode": "map",
          "markdown": "<div style='font-size:18px; line-height:1.55; min-height:84vh;'><div style='font-size:14px; color:#64748b; letter-spacing:.03em; margin:0 0 8px;'>5 · Output · Pollutants: synthetic (CAMS needs an account) · Weather: Aurora 1.5 · Additional method</div><p style='margin:0 0 10px;'>In this run mixing height, wind and temperature come from Aurora 1.5 initialised with ARCO-ERA5; pollutant concentrations are synthetic (CAMS needs an account). The AQI values are therefore illustrative, while the stagnation hours are real model output.</p><table style='border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; font-size:16px; margin:6px 0 10px;'><thead><tr><th style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:14px; white-space:nowrap;'>Site</th><th style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:14px; white-space:nowrap;'>Now</th><th style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:14px; white-space:nowrap;'>Peak</th><th style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:14px; white-space:nowrap;'>Category</th><th style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:14px; white-space:nowrap;'>Dominant</th><th style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:14px; white-space:nowrap;'>GRAP</th><th style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:14px; white-space:nowrap;'>Stagnant h</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Anand Vihar</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>385</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>500</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Severe</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>PM10</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>4</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>12</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Dwarka Sector 8</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>336</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>406</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Severe</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>PM2.5</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>3</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>16</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Gurugram Vikas Sadan</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>376</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>479</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Severe</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>PM10</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>4</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>15</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>ITO</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>383</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>498</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Severe</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>PM10</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>4</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>13</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Jahangirpuri</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>365</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>452</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Severe</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>PM10</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>4</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>14</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Noida Sector 62</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>340</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>409</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Severe</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>PM2.5</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>3</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>10</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Okhla Phase 2</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>366</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>453</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Severe</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>PM10</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>4</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>11</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Punjabi Bagh</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>346</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>415</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Severe</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>PM2.5</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>3</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>14</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>R K Puram</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>335</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>405</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Severe</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>PM2.5</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>3</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>13</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Rohini</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>337</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>406</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Severe</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>PM2.5</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>3</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>16</td></tr></tbody></table><p style='margin:0 0 10px;'>All sites peak around 7 Nov 05:30 IST (minimum mixing height 64–75 m). Site colours on the map are the peak category; use ⓘ to click sites and cells for values. Output files: <code style='background:rgba(100,116,139,.18); padding:0 4px; border-radius:4px; font-size:.92em;'>pollutants_12h.csv</code>, <code style='background:rgba(100,116,139,.18); padding:0 4px; border-radius:4px; font-size:.92em;'>meteorology_hourly.csv</code>, <code style='background:rgba(100,116,139,.18); padding:0 4px; border-radius:4px; font-size:.92em;'>fused_hourly.csv</code>, <code style='background:rgba(100,116,139,.18); padding:0 4px; border-radius:4px; font-size:.92em;'>summary_by_site.csv</code>, <code style='background:rgba(100,116,139,.18); padding:0 4px; border-radius:4px; font-size:.92em;'>messages_{ko,en,hi}.json</code>, <code style='background:rgba(100,116,139,.18); padding:0 4px; border-radius:4px; font-size:.92em;'>bulletin_*.md</code>, <code style='background:rgba(100,116,139,.18); padding:0 4px; border-radius:4px; font-size:.92em;'>frontend/*.json</code>.</p></div>",
