    "19eb2671-b259-5107-af34-9bcf3e50fd4e": {
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "name": "14. Stagnation probability from the ensemble",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 10.46,
        "extent": [
          8421319.48,
          3274212.69,
          8643958.46,
          3382011.46
        ],
        "enableIdentify": true,
        "content": {
          "contentMode": "map",
          "markdown": "<div style='font-size:18px; line-height:1.55; min-height:84vh;'><div style='font-size:14px; color:#64748b; letter-spacing:.03em; margin:0 0 8px;'>Roadmap run 1 · uncertainty · Ensemble: Aurora 1.5 Ensemble · Additional method</div><p style='margin:0 0 10px;'>Aurora 1.5 Ensemble was run 3 times with different seeds (48 hourly steps each); each member's mixing height and wind decide stagnation, and the share of stagnant members is the probability. This is uncertainty the model computed.</p><p style='margin:0 0 10px;'>The blue shading on the map is the per-cell stagnation probability at 7 Nov 05:30 IST (share of members with wind below 10 km/h and mixing height below 500 m). The table gives each site's mean probability for the first night (5 Nov 22:00 to 6 Nov 08:00), the day (6 Nov 08:00–22:00) and the second night, plus the 10th–90th percentile mixing height at the peak hour.</p><table style='border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; font-size:16px; margin:6px 0 10px;'><thead><tr><th style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:14px; white-space:nowrap;'>Site</th><th style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:14px; white-space:nowrap;'>Night 1</th><th style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:14px; white-space:nowrap;'>Day</th><th style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:14px; white-space:nowrap;'>Night 2</th><th style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:14px; white-space:nowrap;'>Peak BLH p10–p90 (m)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Anand Vihar</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>3%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>21%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>43%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>79–107</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>ITO</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>3%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>21%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>43%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>80–105</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Punjabi Bagh</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>12%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>24%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>50%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>86–101</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Rohini</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>12%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>28%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>50%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>87–100</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Jahangirpuri</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>12%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>28%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>50%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>85–102</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>R K Puram</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>6%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>21%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>43%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>82–103</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Dwarka Sector 8</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>18%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>26%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>50%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>88–99</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Okhla Phase 2</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>0%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>19%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>40%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>78–107</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Noida Sector 62</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>3%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>21%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>43%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>78–109</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Gurugram Vikas Sadan</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>18%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>26%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:nowrap;'>57%</td><td style='text-align: