        "enableIdentify": true,
        "content": {
          "contentMode": "map",
          "markdown": "<div style='font-size:18px; line-height:1.55; min-height:84vh;'><div style='font-size:14px; color:#64748b; letter-spacing:.03em; margin:0 0 8px;'>Roadmap run 4 · delivery adapter · Additional method</div><p style='margin:0 0 10px;'>Each subscriber's postal code is mapped to the nearest site, the per-language <code style='background:rgba(100,116,139,.18); padding:0 4px; border-radius:4px; font-size:.92em;'>short</code> message becomes the payload and a delivery log is written. This run is a dry run, so items are logged as \"queued\"; a real adapter would POST to the WhatsApp Business API or an SMS gateway here.</p><table style='border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; font-size:16px; margin:6px 0 10px;'><thead><tr><th style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:14px; white-space:nowrap;'>Item</th><th style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:14px; white-space:nowrap;'>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Items</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>20</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Channel</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>dryrun</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>Languages</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:4px 7px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); white-space:normal;'>en, hi</td></tr></tbody></table><p style='margin:0 0 10px;'><b>Log sample</b></p><pre style='font-size:15px; line-height:1.45; white-space:pre-wrap; background:rgba(100,116,139,.12); padding:8px 11px; border-radius:8px; margin:6px 0 10px;'>sub-000 · PIN 110092 · Anand Vihar · hi · queued (dry run) · 155 chars\n  [वायु गुणवत्ता चेतावनी] Anand Vihar: अधिकतम AQI 500 (गंभीर), 07 Nov 05:30 IST के आसपास। मुख्य प्रदूषक PM10, PM2.5 अधिकतम 321 µg/m³। स्वस्थ लोग भी प्रभावित।\nsub-001 · PIN 110092 · Anand Vihar · en · queued (dry run) · 166 chars\n  [Air quality alert] Anand Vihar: peak AQI 500 (Severe) expected around 07 Nov 05:30 IST. Main pollutant PM10, PM2.5 up to 321 ug/m3. Even healthy people are affected.\nsub-002 · PIN 110002 · ITO · hi · queued (dry run) · 147 chars\n  [वायु गुणवत्ता चेतावनी] ITO: अधिकतम AQI 498 (गंभीर), 07 Nov 05:30 IST के आसपास। मुख्य प्रदूषक PM10, PM2.5 अधिकतम 318 µg/m³। स्वस्थ लोग भी प्रभावित।</pre></div>",
